"The Ensnarer of Minds was the knight skill of Iella-inwer, Stuart's mother."
"It creates mind snares, and can shelter another's mind from an attacking mind trap."
"It can remove things from a person's attention and erase words they hear."
"Carried to its farthest extreme it becomes the loving lie: a life with all pain hidden away."
"A mind held in it long can keep broken holes and a lifelike phantom of its maker afterward."
